    "sequence_set_comparison_limitation": "A sequence appearing in both loopback and receive-API sets proves only that it was returned at least once in the interval; an ACKNACK retransmission received before gap end can mask a missing first transmission. Use acknack_requested_first_delivery_windows to compare first capture, ACKNACK, and receive-API times."
